%description:
Tests Nagle after an uncork. The client corks and writes 1500 bytes: the
full-sized segment goes, and the cork holds the 500 bytes after it. The uncork
at t=1.1 does not send them, because 1000 bytes are not acknowledged and Nagle
(RFC 9293 section 3.7.4) applies again, as Linux __tcp_sock_set_cork(). The ACK
at t=1.203 sends them, with PSH.

%inifile: omnetpp.ini
[General]
record-vector-results = false
ned-path = .;../../../../src;../../lib

cmdenv-event-banners=false
cmdenv-express-mode=false

*.testing=true
cmdenv-log-prefix="[%c]: "

*.cli_app.corkScript="0.5 1; 1.1 0"
*.cli_app.sendScript="1.0 1500"
*.*_tcp.mss = 1000
*.cli_tcp.increasedIWEnabled = true

include ../../lib/defaults.ini

%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%file: postrun.pl
open FILE, '<test.out';
while($sor = <FILE>)
{
    if ($sor =~ /^\[testing\]: (.*)$/)
    {
        print "$1\n";
    }
}
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%postrun-command:  perl ./postrun.pl
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: postrun-command(1).out
[1.001 A003] A.1000 > B.2000: A 1:1001(1000) ack 501 win 16384 
[1.203 B002] A.1000 < B.2000: A ack 1001 win 16384 
[1.205 A004] A.1000 > B.2000: A P 1001:1501(500) ack 501 win 16384 
[1.407 B003] A.1000 < B.2000: A ack 1501 win 16384 
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: stdout
Cannot send (last) segment due to Nagle, not enough data for a full segment
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%postrun-command: grep "undisposed object:" test.out > test_undisposed.out || true
%not-contains: test_undisposed.out
undisposed object: (
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
